  Hypothesis FCH : ltac2:(zQ "b0!nb!q5!itd!iu5!s7!jib!hia!jj8!jk1!o2!ld>0@3$4$2@3$5?3BOT@2$1@1$0#k0?2sp?3TOP$3>0@3$4$2@3$5@2$1@1$0#k0?2sp@2$1@1$0#k0?2s0?3TOP$3@2$6@2$a@2$9@2$1@1$0#k0?2sp+h0@2$1@1$0#k0?2s0@5$8$7?1m?3TOP@2$1@1$0#k0?2s0?2CH").
